WEBVTT

00:00:07.910 --> 00:00:12.450
Right now, there are talks about holding
a Japan-China joint training camp.

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:17.200
"Notice for Japan-China Joint Training Camp"

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:17.200
You're one of the potential
gymnasts to participate in it.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:21.620
The objective is to sharpen each other's
techniques with our top gymnasts.

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:25.540
China's super-ace,
Liu Longxiang will be there, too.

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:28.290
I'm sure it'll be helpful for you right now.

00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:30.000
When does it start?!

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.950
It's from July 1st to the 6th.

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:35.660
July...

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:38.790
You busy then?

00:00:38.790 --> 00:00:41.080
It's Rei's birthday...

00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:43.910
I see.

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:47.160
A lost cicada,

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:50.250
a sad straw hat,

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:52.580
and the sound of...

00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:55.910
If you're not here for my birthday,
then we're not family...

00:01:18.370 --> 00:01:26.910
"The Gymnastics Samurai"

00:02:31.580 --> 00:02:35.000
Come to think of it, Leochi isn't back yet?

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:37.200
No, why?

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:41.290
Being a one-man army's tiring me out.

00:02:41.290 --> 00:02:43.830
I'm sure he'll be back soon.

00:02:47.040 --> 00:02:49.410
He came to us unexpectedly...

00:02:49.410 --> 00:02:52.450
It wouldn't be strange
for him to leave us like this.

00:02:54.910 --> 00:02:57.910
But he probably doesn't have anywhere
to go, and he's a fugitive ninja.

00:02:57.910 --> 00:02:59.370
We accept those who come

00:02:59.370 --> 00:03:01.000
and do not chase those who leave.

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:03.540
And we do <i>not </i>pry at all.

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:12.620
See you tomorrow, Ayu!

00:03:12.620 --> 00:03:14.290
Laters!

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:17.040
Rei, be careful.

00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:18.450
I will!

00:03:21.410 --> 00:03:23.830
Ms. Mari, that was harsh.

00:03:26.700 --> 00:03:28.790
It'll be even sadder for her
if we give her false hope

00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:30.870
and then he doesn't come back.

00:03:31.870 --> 00:03:35.290
"Samurai Father and Daughter"

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:37.450
"Samurai Father and Daughter"

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:37.450
I'm home!

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:38.620
Welcome back.

00:03:40.910 --> 00:03:43.750
He's still not back?

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:45.700
I wonder what he's doing.

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:47.910
"Police 24-Hrs Ikebukuro Edition"

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:49.660
"Police 24-Hrs Ikebukuro Edition"

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:49.660
The young people who cause unrest

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:52.040
"Police 24-Hrs Ikebukuro Edition"

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:52.040
wandering the streets of Ikebukuro
with nowhere to go.

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:56.290
"Street gangs! Gal circles!"
"Closing in on Ikebukuro nights!"

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:56.290
What is going on with them right now?

00:03:56.290 --> 00:04:00.790
--It's crazy out there.
--Street gangs and gal circles...

00:04:00.790 --> 00:04:04.250
Dad, you should be careful
when you have practice late.

00:04:04.250 --> 00:04:05.620
Yeah.

00:04:08.910 --> 00:04:11.750
Actually, I wanted to talk to you about that.

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:15.250
What?! About street gangs, or gal circles?!

00:04:15.250 --> 00:04:17.910
Neither. About practice.

00:04:17.910 --> 00:04:21.290
Whew. I thought you'd already
gotten involved with them.

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:28.040
Today, Amakusa asked me if I wanted
to participate in a training camp.

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:29.080
Training camp?

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:30.200
Yeah.

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:32.620
A joint training camp between China and Japan.

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:35.160
Top gymnasts from China will be coming.

00:04:35.160 --> 00:04:36.500
That's amazing!

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:37.870
Yeah.

00:04:37.870 --> 00:04:39.500
But...

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:41.580
There's one problem.

00:04:41.580 --> 00:04:42.620
Hm?

00:04:42.620 --> 00:04:47.160
The training camp is from July 1st to the 6th.

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:48.000
Huh?

00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:52.500
Of course, I haven't forgotten
about your birthday!

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:57.080
But Chinese gymnasts are said
to be the best in the world.

00:04:57.080 --> 00:04:59.830
It's a valuable opportunity
to watch them practice up close.

00:04:59.830 --> 00:05:02.040
If possible, I...

00:05:02.040 --> 00:05:04.660
...think I want to participate.

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:14.410
I guess it can't be helped.

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:19.160
It's fine. You can't skip
such an important training camp.

00:05:19.160 --> 00:05:21.540
I'll definitely celebrate your birthday!

00:05:21.540 --> 00:05:23.290
I'm really sorry!

00:05:23.290 --> 00:05:24.660
It's fine.

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:44.410
You should just smile.

00:05:44.410 --> 00:05:45.870
You should jus--

00:05:50.290 --> 00:05:51.790
Aragaki, Aragaki!

00:05:51.790 --> 00:05:55.750
I saw online that our gymnasts are
doing a joint training camp with China!

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:58.000
It sounds pretty amazing!

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:59.950
I hope the Samurai can participate!

00:05:59.950 --> 00:06:02.290
China Samura--

00:06:02.290 --> 00:06:03.660
H... Huh?

00:06:03.660 --> 00:06:05.500
Sh-Should I do this?

00:06:05.500 --> 00:06:07.620
Oh! Sorry...

00:06:12.790 --> 00:06:18.000
Mom, Dad won't be around
for my birthday this year.

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:20.700
I don't know if Leo's coming back, either.

00:06:20.700 --> 00:06:25.120
But it's a really important time for Dad.

00:06:25.120 --> 00:06:27.000
I need to bear it, huh?

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:30.450
"Aragaki Family Grave"

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:33.040
"Aragaki Family Grave"

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:33.040
I wish I could be like you…

00:06:33.040 --> 00:06:34.660
"Aragaki Family Grave"

00:06:41.290 --> 00:06:45.040
Bigbird, let's play movie pretend!

00:06:45.040 --> 00:06:47.580
Me?

00:06:47.580 --> 00:06:48.950
Just kidding.

00:06:49.950 --> 00:06:51.950
"Domestic Beef Kalbi (4 servings)"

00:07:02.160 --> 00:07:03.620
Here I go!

00:07:33.620 --> 00:07:35.790
Rei, are you feeling sick?

00:07:35.790 --> 00:07:38.450
Huh? No, I'm totally fine.

00:07:38.450 --> 00:07:39.620
Maybe you should drink some milk--

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:42.200
I don't need any right now.

00:07:42.200 --> 00:07:45.330
I see. Don't push yourself.

00:07:45.330 --> 00:07:48.700
I won't. Same to you, Dad.

00:07:48.700 --> 00:07:50.910
Right...

00:07:50.910 --> 00:07:55.540
The training camp this time will be the
first time gymnasts from Japan and China

00:07:55.540 --> 00:07:57.330
will practice together.

00:07:57.330 --> 00:08:01.950
How do the Chinese gymnasts,
called the best in the world, practice?

00:08:01.950 --> 00:08:06.410
And how do they feel as they face gymnastics?

00:08:06.410 --> 00:08:08.620
I hope you will take that all in.

00:08:08.620 --> 00:08:14.250
Moreover, please think individually
about how we can win agai--

00:08:14.250 --> 00:08:15.870
I-I'm sorry...!

00:08:18.250 --> 00:08:19.700
Oh, hello?

00:08:19.700 --> 00:08:21.830
You're just going to answer normally?

00:08:21.830 --> 00:08:24.000
It's me, Rei. Can you talk now?

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:26.160
U-Um, uh, what is it?

00:08:26.160 --> 00:08:29.200
I was just wondering what
time you'd be home tonight.

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:33.250
I'll be late, so I'll eat dinner with Amakusa.

00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:34.910
Oh, really?

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:37.200
--I forgot to tell you...
--I'm very sorry about this.

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:39.700
I'm glad you told me
before I bought ingredients.

00:08:39.700 --> 00:08:41.620
I'll eat by myself then.

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:42.870
Sorry.

00:08:42.870 --> 00:08:45.830
It's fine. Do your best, Dad.

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:48.290
Yeah, I will.

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:49.410
Bye-bye.

00:08:55.450 --> 00:08:56.830
I'm very sorry...

00:08:58.700 --> 00:09:00.660
I'll turn off my phone...

00:09:03.370 --> 00:09:07.750
Whatever. If no one's going to be home,
then I'll just take it easy today.

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:18.450
Beat the ghosts!

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:28.870
I'm not going to clean up today.

00:09:28.870 --> 00:09:30.910
I'll watch one of Mom's movies.

00:09:32.660 --> 00:09:35.160
Ow...!

00:09:38.410 --> 00:09:39.540
Jeez!

00:09:54.870 --> 00:09:56.370
Yum!

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:10.580
No good!

00:10:10.580 --> 00:10:12.830
Hm? Bigbird?

00:10:12.830 --> 00:10:14.120
Bigbird?!

00:10:18.910 --> 00:10:22.750
The number you have dialed
is currently unavailable.

00:10:22.750 --> 00:10:25.870
Please hang up and try again.

00:10:27.200 --> 00:10:31.370
♪ Why don't we fall in love? (wow wow wow wow) ♪

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:46.450
"Kamematsu Animal Hospital"

00:11:03.620 --> 00:11:06.620
You have to eat a little.

00:11:06.620 --> 00:11:07.750
Rei.

00:11:12.700 --> 00:11:14.410
What's with that bird?

00:11:14.410 --> 00:11:17.620
I got him from a friend of mine
from South America.

00:11:17.620 --> 00:11:20.410
This bird's supposed to bring good luck.

00:11:20.410 --> 00:11:21.830
South America...?

00:11:27.870 --> 00:11:30.370
He's got a big beak...

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:32.620
You can name him whatever you want.

00:11:34.370 --> 00:11:36.080
Bigbird...

00:11:39.830 --> 00:11:42.330
You should just smile.

00:11:49.330 --> 00:11:52.040
That's a large bird you've got there.

00:11:52.040 --> 00:11:54.330
How's Bigbird?

00:11:54.330 --> 00:11:57.330
Looks like acute stress disorder.

00:11:57.330 --> 00:12:00.290
You can't feed bird meat to a bird.

00:12:01.620 --> 00:12:05.660
We'll keep him here and see what happens.

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:07.950
Please fix him!

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:14.120
It was my fault...

00:12:24.410 --> 00:12:25.790
I'm home!

00:12:29.200 --> 00:12:30.330
Rei?

00:12:33.540 --> 00:12:35.000
She's at the bar?

00:12:38.080 --> 00:12:41.290
Joe! I have returned, indubitably!

00:12:41.290 --> 00:12:43.540
What have you been doing this whole time?

00:12:43.540 --> 00:12:47.580
Huh? I wrote that I was
going to go train, indeed.

00:12:47.580 --> 00:12:50.950
Rachel! I'm home!

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:52.580
She's not here.

00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:55.450
Did she go out with BB?

00:13:02.620 --> 00:13:03.870
"Missed Call"
"Rei"

00:13:04.330 --> 00:13:05.450
Rei...

00:13:12.000 --> 00:13:15.370
Joe, where did Rachel and BB go?

00:13:19.750 --> 00:13:20.830
Hello?

00:13:20.830 --> 00:13:22.200
Who's this?

00:13:22.200 --> 00:13:24.370
It's me, Jotaro.

00:13:24.370 --> 00:13:28.410
Where's Rei? It's so loud,
I didn't hear the phone when she called.

00:13:28.410 --> 00:13:31.040
She wasn't home when I got back. Neither was BB.

00:13:31.040 --> 00:13:32.910
Did she say anything to you?

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:36.950
No. If she's not home
or at the bar at this time of night,

00:13:36.950 --> 00:13:38.790
then maybe something happened.

00:13:38.790 --> 00:13:40.790
--Huh?
--Anyway, I'll go look for her.

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:44.200
What happened? You don't know where Rachel is?

00:13:47.790 --> 00:13:50.120
Oh, I'll go, too, indeed!

00:13:52.870 --> 00:13:54.910
Leo, you go look near the supermarket.

00:13:54.910 --> 00:13:56.080
Roger!

00:13:58.660 --> 00:14:01.120
Sorry to cause you trouble.

00:14:01.120 --> 00:14:03.040
I'm counting on you.

00:14:03.040 --> 00:14:06.290
Yeah, yeah, "Operation 'Bukuroad."

00:14:06.290 --> 00:14:08.540
KK, thanks!

00:14:08.540 --> 00:14:10.370
Rei!

00:14:10.370 --> 00:14:12.450
Rachel, where are you?

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:14.450
Leo's here for you!

00:15:02.950 --> 00:15:04.620
Ms. Mari, found her.

00:15:04.620 --> 00:15:08.450
Ayu? "Operation 'Bukuroad" complete.

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:16.330
Rei.

00:15:16.330 --> 00:15:17.910
Grandma.

00:15:17.910 --> 00:15:20.540
You delinquent girl.

00:15:20.540 --> 00:15:24.000
I'm sorry... I didn't want to be at home...

00:15:29.500 --> 00:15:35.000
Up until now, there were times when
Dad had competitions and wasn't home,

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:38.620
but just having BB around made it fine...

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:41.450
Ever since Leo came,
even when Dad wasn't around,

00:15:41.450 --> 00:15:44.160
he'd always play with me and make things fun...

00:15:44.160 --> 00:15:47.250
And he'd listen when
I needed someone to talk to.

00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:50.620
But then Leo left,

00:15:50.620 --> 00:15:54.870
and things that had been fine
suddenly weren't fine...

00:15:54.870 --> 00:15:57.120
I said things I regretted and got mad,

00:15:57.120 --> 00:16:00.540
and even did something terrible to BB...

00:16:00.540 --> 00:16:02.330
I wanted to be like Mom,

00:16:02.330 --> 00:16:05.450
but I'm just getting further
and further away from her...

00:16:05.450 --> 00:16:08.660
I don't know what to do anymore...

00:16:10.500 --> 00:16:12.620
Is that what it was?

00:16:12.620 --> 00:16:16.000
You've got a hard road ahead
if you want to be like her.

00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:20.200
In the first place, Tomoyo is a little
different from what you think.

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:21.500
Huh?

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:24.870
It's true that normally, she was very refined,

00:16:24.870 --> 00:16:28.660
but when she was sloppy, she was <i>really </i>sloppy.

00:16:28.660 --> 00:16:31.660
And when she was mad, she'd yell really loud,

00:16:31.660 --> 00:16:34.330
and there were times when
just yelling wasn't enough.

00:16:36.250 --> 00:16:38.120
Mom was like that?

00:16:38.120 --> 00:16:42.080
Everyone needs to relax and
vent sometimes, or it's too draining.

00:16:42.080 --> 00:16:43.790
Especially with your dad.

00:16:43.790 --> 00:16:46.580
If you don't make it obvious,
he won't understand anything.

00:16:46.580 --> 00:16:49.290
He's beyond the level of just clueless.

00:16:49.290 --> 00:16:50.410
But--

00:16:50.410 --> 00:16:53.620
She never acted like that in front of you?

00:16:53.620 --> 00:17:00.160
No. She was always kind, always smiling,
and always supporting Dad...

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:05.580
She wanted to always show her
best side in front of her dear daughter.

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:07.660
What was your mom's job?

00:17:07.660 --> 00:17:10.540
Oh! A famous actress!

00:17:10.540 --> 00:17:15.370
Which means, you always got to see
her act from the best seat in the house.

00:17:18.080 --> 00:17:22.790
That's why there's no reason
for you grin and bear it.

00:17:22.790 --> 00:17:26.160
You should say whatever you want to say.

00:17:26.160 --> 00:17:27.540
Rei!

00:17:36.040 --> 00:17:37.000
Oh, good...

00:17:37.000 --> 00:17:39.330
Rei, I was so worried!

00:17:39.330 --> 00:17:41.120
I was so, so worried!

00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:43.330
You can't do this... wandering...

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:45.950
Wandering is bad... dangerous...

00:17:45.950 --> 00:17:48.700
It's really dangerous...!

00:17:51.080 --> 00:17:54.160
Sorry, I know I promised
to take you to the park...

00:17:54.160 --> 00:17:57.000
It's okay. Do your best at practice!

00:17:57.000 --> 00:18:00.410
The competition's coming up, so I won't
be able to play with you for a while.

00:18:00.410 --> 00:18:02.580
I'm watching a bunch of movies, so I'm fine!

00:18:02.580 --> 00:18:03.790
Sorry, Rei.

00:18:03.790 --> 00:18:05.200
It's fine!

00:18:05.200 --> 00:18:06.660
Rei, I'm sorry.

00:18:06.660 --> 00:18:08.330
I know.

00:18:08.330 --> 00:18:09.870
I'm really sorry!

00:18:09.870 --> 00:18:12.620
Don't worry about it.

00:18:12.620 --> 00:18:16.540
Happy birthday!
Here's your present for this year!

00:18:18.370 --> 00:18:19.790
Thanks!

00:18:19.790 --> 00:18:22.040
Don't go too far on it.

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:25.370
I...

00:18:28.120 --> 00:18:29.410
I...

00:18:29.410 --> 00:18:32.410
...can't actually ride a bike!

00:18:32.410 --> 00:18:33.750
Huh?!

00:18:33.750 --> 00:18:39.500
I was really... really happy
that you bought me a bike...

00:18:39.500 --> 00:18:43.500
But, it was right before a competition,

00:18:43.500 --> 00:18:46.870
so I couldn't ask you
to teach me how to ride it...!

00:18:52.410 --> 00:18:53.450
Rei!

00:18:53.450 --> 00:18:56.370
I'm...! I-I'm sorry!

00:18:56.370 --> 00:18:59.620
I'm so sorry! Rei, I'm sorry!

00:18:59.620 --> 00:19:01.660
--Sorry... Sorry... Sorry!

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:05.410
--All you do is cause problems
for your wife and your daughter.
--Sorry... Sorry... Sorry!

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:08.620
How did I give birth to something like that?

00:19:10.870 --> 00:19:13.330
Sorry... Sorry...!

00:19:13.330 --> 00:19:16.830
I'm glad! I'm glad, indeed!

00:19:16.830 --> 00:19:17.660
--Wha--?!
--Hm?

00:19:17.660 --> 00:19:18.750
Leo?!

00:19:18.750 --> 00:19:21.700
Rachel, where did you go?

00:19:21.700 --> 00:19:25.200
I was worried about you, indeed!

00:19:25.200 --> 00:19:26.620
That's <i>my </i>line!

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:28.080
Huh?!

00:19:28.080 --> 00:19:29.870
R-Rachel...?

00:19:29.870 --> 00:19:31.370
Just going off like that!

00:19:31.370 --> 00:19:33.080
Where have you been this whole time?

00:19:33.080 --> 00:19:34.660
T-Training--

00:19:34.660 --> 00:19:36.750
Write <i>how long </i>you'll be gone!

00:19:36.750 --> 00:19:38.540
I thought I would never see you again!

00:19:38.540 --> 00:19:40.200
You stupid ninja!

00:19:41.250 --> 00:19:44.500
N-Ninja Technique: <i>Dogeza</i>!

00:19:45.950 --> 00:19:47.950
"Kamematsu Animal Hospital"

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:50.830
Good mornin'!

00:19:50.830 --> 00:19:52.620
Bigbird!

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:55.120
You don't have to worry anymore.

00:19:55.120 --> 00:19:56.410
I'm sorry!

00:19:56.410 --> 00:19:59.200
You should just smile.

00:20:06.250 --> 00:20:08.410
Don't rush. You can just go slowly.

00:20:08.410 --> 00:20:09.660
Okay.

00:20:09.660 --> 00:20:12.540
Where there's a will, there's a way, Rachel!

00:20:12.540 --> 00:20:16.870
I'll hold on, so just go slowly. Slowly.

00:20:16.870 --> 00:20:20.450
You're doing great! Rachel! Good job, indeed!

00:20:23.700 --> 00:20:24.660
Oh?

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:26.290
Hey, wait up!

00:20:26.290 --> 00:20:28.370
Wait, don't go so fast...!

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:30.040
Oh?

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:31.120
Huh?

00:20:32.160 --> 00:20:35.290
Dad! I'm doing it!

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:39.790
It was easy!

00:20:39.790 --> 00:20:42.410
She has an amazing sense of balance, indeed...

00:20:42.410 --> 00:20:45.500
That's my daughter for you...

00:20:45.500 --> 00:20:48.750
BB, come here!

00:20:48.750 --> 00:20:50.040
Me?

00:20:51.830 --> 00:20:53.580
Hang on!

00:20:57.870 --> 00:21:00.700
BB...!

00:21:01.830 --> 00:21:04.250
We're flying!

00:21:08.290 --> 00:21:10.950
Rachel looks like she'll be fine now.

00:21:15.450 --> 00:21:16.580
You know what?

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:21.750
I definitely don't want you to use me
as an excuse to give up gymnastics.

00:21:21.750 --> 00:21:24.080
Go work hard at the training camp!

00:21:24.080 --> 00:21:26.250
I'll do my best.

00:21:26.250 --> 00:21:29.000
Yeah, do your best, Samurai!
